COMMENT ON COLUMN advising.person_support_referral.referring_person_identifier IS 'Person who initiated the referral, when the referral was initiated by a person rather than an automated process.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN advising.person_support_referral.resource_identifier IS 'Support resource, service, or program to which the person was referred, when applicable.';
