COMMENT ON COLUMN advising.person_support_referral.referral_status_identifier IS 'Governed reference-code value describing the referral lifecycle status.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN advising.person_support_referral.referral_reason IS 'Reason or support need motivating the referral.';
